{"title":"Wreaths \u0026 Garlands","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas Wreaths \u0026amp; Garlands\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eArtificial Christmas wreaths and garlands from King of Christmas offer a complete selection of holiday décor designed to bring dimension, structure, and seasonal character into your home. Crafted to replicate the look and feel of real evergreen branches, each piece is made with durable materials for dependable use year after year.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThis collection includes a full range of Christmas wreaths and garlands, from traditional green styles to illuminated designs and flocked options that mimic freshly fallen snow. These pieces can be styled alongside complementary décor such as one of our Christmas accent trees, ornaments, and holiday ribbon, helping you build a layered and thoughtfully styled look across your space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you're decorating a front door, mantel, staircase, or entryway, or styling them alongside a full artificial Christmas tree, these wreaths and garlands help create a balanced, cohesive holiday look throughout your home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our full collection of artificial Christmas wreaths and garlands to find the perfect finishing touches for your space this holiday season.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"24inch-royal-fir-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" Royal Fir Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExtremely intricate with life-like foliage and detailed tips, the Royal Fir line is considered to be one of our premium selections. Assembled with the same materials and quality build as the Royal Fir tree. The Royal Fir Wreath is an excellent choice to compliment our Royal Fir tree. Appropriate for indoor and outdoor use, this wreath is perfect for hanging on doors, walls, or by the fireplace. Set a festive tone this holiday when welcoming your family and friends this season when you choose the royal fir wreath.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642944680000,"sku":"RF-W24IN-U","price":79.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-4.jpg?v=1714674128"},{"product_id":"24-king-douglas-fir-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" King Douglas Fir Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe King Douglas Fir Wreath really stands in a class of its own. Like our King Douglas Fir Tree, it features a crafty combination of classic (PVC) and realistic (PE) tips, producing a truly realistic-looking lush green foliage. Suitable for indoor and outdoor use, the King Douglas Fir Wreath is perfect to hang on doors, walls, or by the fireplace mantel. The King Douglas Fir Wreath is the perfect way to embrace the holiday season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642945663040,"sku":"KDF-W24-U","price":69.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingDouglasFirWreathUnlit.png?v=1784735554"},{"product_id":"24-yorkshire-fir-wreath-unlit","title":"24\" Yorkshire Fir Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eLike the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/yorkshire-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003eYorkshire Fir Tree\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, King of Christmas’s Yorkshire Fir Wreath is a magnificent addition to your Christmas decor. Constructed with 150 classic tips ensures a full, voluminous shape, being quite the attraction for your door, window, or fireplace. The Yorkshire Fir wreath will be a pleasant extension of all things Christmas, and an excellent way to round out the final decorating touches in your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642946285632,"sku":"YF-W24IN-U","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/yorkshire-fir-wreath.jpg?v=1722014829"},{"product_id":"24-cypress-spruce-wreath","title":"24\" Cypress Spruce Wreath Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhether you place it on your door or on top of your fireplace, the Cypress Spruce Wreath will stand out and demand notice. Inspired by our prestigious \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/cypress-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCypress Spruce Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, this wreath oozes aristocracy and nobility. Designed with the same tasteful blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) as the Cypress Spruce tree, resulting in a grand and beautiful Christmas wreath. Indulge in all things regal by adding the Cypress Spruce Wreath to your Christmas collection this season. \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642950086720,"sku":"CS-W24IN","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021cypress-51.jpg?v=1714673746"},{"product_id":"36-inch-king-fraser-led","title":"36\" King Fraser Fir Wreath with Warm White LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eKing of Christmas’s King Fraser Fir wreath is a magnificent addition to your Christmas decor. With its green life-like foliage, the king Fraser fir wreath features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting a full, voluminous shape, being quite the attraction for your door or fireplace. The King Fraser Fir Wreath will be a pleasant extension of all things Christmas in your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":30080365133888,"sku":"KFF-W36IN-L","price":149.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFrasier-4-2_2068e758-081b-4521-b4fe-a62dc95a5d9a.jpg?v=1714673989"},{"product_id":"3-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"3' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo Christmas setting is complete without at least one tabletop tree! A scaled down version of our signature flock collection, the small but mighty Queen Flock mini Christmas tree sits perfectly on any tabletop, fireplace hearth, or anywhere else that needs a “little” Christmas spirit. 3 feet tall and 18” wide, this portable beauty can easily be moved around anywhere for quick and easy redecorating. Plus, with a blend of realistic and classic needle tips combined with handmade heavily flocked branches, you and your loved ones will get to enjoy the magical feeling of freshly fallen snow in the warmth of your own home\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284858908872,"sku":"QF-T3-U","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021QueenFlock-2-2_a4936b8b-b425-4e84-bc55-9ba70b26462d.jpg?v=1714674019"},{"product_id":"royal-fir-led-collections","title":"Royal Fir Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery  Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eShopping for your holiday décor just got easier with the all-inclusive Royal Fir Collection. With unmatched, hand-crafted precision that is as lifelike as it gets, this collection instantly enhances any setting and perfectly complements our signature Royal Fir Christmas Tree. Expertly pre- strung with warm white LED lights, the Royal Fir Collection includes: \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e2 3’ Royal Fir Christmas Trees, \n\u003cbr\u003e1 Royal Fir Wreath, and \n\u003cbr\u003e1 Royal Fir Garland. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis elegant collection is the perfect upgrade for your fireplace or entryway. The possibilities are endless! Make the Royal Fir collection a staple of your family tradition for years to come, with its rare durability and timeless design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eFor added convenience, each piece in this collection is battery operated with an automatic timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off, allowing you to enjoy its beauty all season long with zero maintenance!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284896329928,"sku":"RF-CL-L-BAT","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-1.jpg?v=1718159290"},{"product_id":"yorkshire-fir-led-collections","title":"Yorkshire Fir Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you need one elegant solution that offers the perfect upgrade for your holiday décor this season, look no further than the Yorkshire Fir Collection. With lush green foliage that offers a dense and luxurious look, this collection will spark endless holiday conversation and is the perfect complement to our signature Yorkshire Fir Christmas Tree. Expertly pre- strung with warm white LED lights, the Yorkshire Fir Collection includes: (2) 3’ Yorkshire Fir Christmas Trees, (1) Yorkshire Fir Wreath, and (1) Yorkshire Fir Garland. This easily shaped collection is just what you need to deck the halls, fireplace, entryway, or anywhere else you’d like to ignite some holiday passion. Spend less time deciding and more time enjoying new traditions with your family, with the one collection that has it all! For added convenience, each piece in this collection is battery operated with an automatic timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off, allowing you to enjoy its beauty all season long with zero maintenance!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284901146824,"sku":"YF-CL-L-BAT","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021Yorkshire-3.jpg?v=1718159365"},{"product_id":"tribeca-spruce-blue-led-collections","title":"Tribeca Blue Spruce Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe holiday season is a joyous time of year for everyone, but the shopping part can be a little stressful at times. With the Tribeca Spruce Collection Set, decorating your home will be a breeze. The Tribeca Spruce Collection perfectly complements our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/tribeca-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\/sort_by=price-ascending\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTribeca Spruce Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. This set features two beautiful 3' pre-lit entryway trees, a pre-lit flexible 9'x12\" garland that can be used to wrap around a banister, hang around doorpost entrance, or drape over a fireplace mantel, and a charming pre-lit wreath to complete the set. This collection set is battery operated with a built-in timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284901769416,"sku":"TSB-CL-L-BAT","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021BlueSpruce-3.jpg?v=1718159354"},{"product_id":"king-noble-led-collections","title":"King Noble Fir Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eKing Noble Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated). When you need one elegant solution that offers the perfect upgrade for your holiday décor this season, look no further than the King Noble Collection. With impossibly realistic foliage, this collection will instantly transform any space in need of a little holiday tradition. Expertly pre- strung with warm white LED lights, the King Noble Collection includes: (2) 3’ King Noble Christmas Trees, (1) King Noble Wreath, and (1) King Noble Garland. This easily shaped collection is just what you need to deck the halls, fireplace, entryway, or anywhere else you’d like to ignite some holiday passion. Spend less time deciding and more time enjoying new traditions with your family, with the one collection that has it all! For added convenience, each piece in this collection is battery operated with an automatic timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off, allowing you to enjoy its beauty all season long with zero maintenance!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42314177544392,"sku":"KNF-CL-L-BAT","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KingNobleCollectionSet1.jpg?v=1714673585"},{"product_id":"9ft-12inch-king-noble-fir-garland-led","title":"9' x 12\" King Noble Fir Garland with Warm White LED Lights (Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe great thing about adding more garlands to your holiday oasis? The versatile decorating possibilities that come with it. Whether you already have one of our signature King Noble Christmas Trees or not, the beautiful King Noble Garland offers the instant upgrade you need to enhance any holiday setting. 9 feet in length and 12” wide, this dense and expansive garland is sure to compliment your décor year after year. With a blend of realistic and classic needle tips, this garland radiates genuine Christmas tradition that will endure decades of memories! The King Noble Garland sits perfectly on your stair railing, fireplace mantel, doorway, or anywhere else you’d like to drape some elegant Christmas spirit this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42788290166984,"sku":"KNF-G9x12-Plug","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingNobleGarland1_0ba166b7-ec51-45d3-b999-8961ea726c6d.jpg?v=1714673633"},{"product_id":"3-foot-royal-fir-led","title":"3' Royal Fir Tabletop Tree with 100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy settle for less this holiday season when you can celebrate in grand style. Add a breathtaking Christmas tree to your home decor when you choose the Royal Fir to grace your home this holiday season. This stunning and magnificent Christmas tree is full-bodied and features realistic foliage that creates a beautiful and lifelike display. The Royal Fir is one of our hallmark signature trees and features a high-end design for the ultimate Christmas tree display. The 3' Royal Fir is a miniature version of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Fir Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. Using the same tips and structure to give the tree a full-bodied and realistic look. The base is made of porcelain and resembles a wooden tree stump. Round out your Christmas collection this holiday season with the 3' Royal Fir tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42852912627912,"sku":"3F-RF-ST-L","price":119.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KOC2021RoyalFir-3-2_17a0b735-0403-4b0c-a7b7-36501dad0817.jpg?v=1718158120"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Wreaths_Garlands.jpg?v=1789054609","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-wreaths-garlands.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}